1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,767
Day five. You wake up, and the inhaler
is gone.

2
00:00:03,267 --> 00:00:09,733
A coconut crab. As long as your arm.
They're called robber crabs. They
steal pots, shoes, anything that
shines.

3
00:00:10,233 --> 00:00:12,167
He's got your medicine. I'll handle
this.

4
00:00:12,667 --> 00:00:14,133
Sam does not handle this.

5
00:00:14,667 --> 00:00:20,500
The crab goes up a palm with your last
three puffs. At sunset it climbs down,
and you drop the cover on it.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,867
Rule ten. Hang up everything you can't
lose.
